---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about ImageTool: our privacy-first mission, browser-native architecture, WebGPU and Web Workers stack, and open source ethos."
  path="/about"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-10 text-slate-700">
    <header class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase">
        Open Source Mission
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        About Us
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Free, private, browser-native image tools designed for the modern web.
      </p>
    </header>

    {/* The Mission */}
    <section class="bg-[#f8f9fc] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">
        Our Mission: True Zero-Cloud Privacy
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        Every day, millions of people upload personal family photos, business screenshots, and confidential documents to online converters and background removers without realizing that those images are stored, analyzed, and processed on remote cloud servers.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        <strong class="text-slate-900">ImageTool was created to change that.</strong> We believe that modern web browsers and personal devices are fast enough to run state-of-the-art vision AI and high-resolution image processing locally. By bringing compute to your device instead of sending your images to the cloud, we eliminate server latency, eliminate cloud hosting costs, and provide a 100% airtight privacy guarantee.
      </p>
    </section>

    {/* The Technology Stack */}
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 text-center">
        How It Works: The Technology Stack
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">WebGPU &amp; WebAssembly</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600">
            Executes quantized ONNX neural networks directly on your device GPU via modern WebGPU compute shaders, with seamless multi-threaded WebAssembly fallback for older devices.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">Background Web Workers</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600">
            Image decoding (via OffscreenCanvas and createImageBitmap) and neural evaluation run in dedicated worker threads, preserving 60 FPS interface smoothness without UI freezing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">Astro Static SEO Shell</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600">
            Static site generation with zero-drift JSON-LD structured data ensures blazing-fast first contentful paint (FCP) and optimal discoverability across search engines.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">Tiled Cosine Blending</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600">
            High-resolution AI upscaling uses mathematical 2D cosine bell curve feathering across overlapping tiles, completely eliminating GPU out-of-memory errors and visible seam lines.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Open Source */}
    <section class="bg-[#f8f9fc] p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">
        Open Source &amp; Community
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        ImageTool is an open-source project hosted on GitHub at <a href="https://github.com/NajeebKalwar/ImageTool" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-medium underline">NajeebKalwar/ImageTool</a>. Contributions, bug reports, feature requests, and code audits are welcome.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
